    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogueEmily",
      "key": "Rainy_Day_3",
      "field": null,
      "source": "I meant to let the parrot go free, but his wing never fully healed. He seems content, though. I give him lots of attention.#$e#He told me that he's happy here.",
      "translation": "Chtěla jsem papouška pustit na svobodu, ale křídlo se mu nikdy úplně nezahojilo. Zdá se však spokojený. Věnuji mu spoustu pozornosti.#$e#Řekl mi, že je tu šťastný.",
      "sourceSHA256": "e1e7b0e71218b13829fb46abe3d36ca696ca1efd34f4f0a0e69f371bc99d1630",
      "translationSHA256": "d4237e7c95e587353bc0f2d428e3f38203b27436e6568235aa6df7fd1d5c2a96",
      "reviewChecks": [
