      "key": "Indoor_Day_3",
      "field": null,
      "source": "My horoscope for the day isn't too good... but I'm going to make the best of it, as always. Let's get to work!",
      "translation": "Dnešní horoskop mi nevěstí nic moc... ale jako vždy se pokusím využít den co nejlépe. Dejme se do práce!",
      "sourceSHA256": "398123bfcd2d239b3e271f5ab47e478b327af47143b9fd27748040af71902980",
      "translationSHA256": "efd8eb6bcb3765a17676981a20f5046122858de9233eb836c42371ef01bcb263",
