      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogueEmily",
      "key": "Indoor_Night_4",
      "field": null,
      "source": "I swept the whole house, washed the windows, dusted, and cleaned the fridge. It was a very productive day!",
      "translation": "Zametla jsem celý dům, umyla okna, utřela prach a vyčistila lednici. Byl to velmi produktivní den!",
      "sourceSHA256": "baf6aae2ac8f22e31d8f07486de76ba28593d94b020cfb84bdbd88a3dd466240",
      "translationSHA256": "0ad3c862ea947c0960ef8a7cf2b75b4865ff961017940f130a0f5a08811471ac",
